            the job list.  In the second form, kkiillll --ll, if _s_i_g is not
            specified the signal names are listed.  Otherwise, for each _s_i_g
            that is a name, the corresponding signal number is listed.  For
            each _s_i_g that is a signal number or a number representing the exit
            status of a process which was terminated or stopped by a signal
