            signals.  Typical examples are SSIIGGCCHHLLDD and SSIIGGCCLLDD or SSIIGGPPOOLLLL and
            SSIIGGIIOO, assuming they correspond to the same signal number.  kkiillll
            --ll will only list the preferred form, however kkiillll --ll _a_l_t will
