                   patterns (use quoting to prevent these from being
                   interpreted as file patterns).  With no attribute flags,
                   all parameters (or functions with the --ff flag) with
                   matching names are printed (the shell option TTYYPPEESSEETT__SSIILLEENNTT
                   is not used in this case).

