     uulliimmiitt [ --HHSSaa ] [ { --bbccddffiikkllmmnnppqqrrssTTttvvwwxx | --NN _r_e_s_o_u_r_c_e } [ _l_i_m_i_t ] ... ]
            Set or display resource limits of the shell and the processes
            started by the shell.  The value of _l_i_m_i_t can be a number in the
            unit specified below or one of the values `uunnlliimmiitteedd', which
            removes the limit on the resource, or `hhaarrdd', which uses the
            current value of the hard limit on the resource.

